PostHog replay-shared mobile transformer

Vendored and adapted from:
https://github.com/PostHog/posthog/tree/ae7a3d2387c655c75d57a9f5c9529aaa46582b6f/common/replay-shared/src/mobile

Local adaptations replace PostHog-internal rrweb type and telemetry imports with
small, compatible local declarations and restrict CSS background images to
inline base64 data. Other transformation behavior remains from the upstream
implementation.

